								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hey guys welcome to Plane of Earth B. Soon&nbsp; you will be doing Rathe Council, may the force be with ya (lol).&nbsp; That mob is a NIGHTMARE!!&nbsp; When we did that I had a coronary and my hubby almost ran me to the hospital..&nbsp; J/K&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />&nbsp; Hey if you need any hellp with that one let me know i will take Rathe Council down with you. Remember to not BREAK MEZ!<br /><br /><br />Gratz Brew Crew<br /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness
						</td>
